      "username": "arenson9",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-10-07T21:41:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This thread is for people who have only one of the Rook City or the Infernal Relics expansion and are looking for someone else who has the other.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Since in the future the Rook City expansion and the Infernal Relics expansion will be published together in a single box, a pair of people who collectively have just one of each could collaborate to get the expansion they need using one of the following methods:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A) Buy and Divide -- The two people buy the combined box and then split the cards. One person or the other keeps the box.</p><p>B) Sell and Buy -- One person sells their existing expansion to the other and then buys the combined box.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Not sure if there's a need for a place like this, but in case there is, make a post saying what you have and how you'd like to collaborate (Buy and Divide or Sell and Buy) and hopefully you'll find someone willing to work with you.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:39:24.357Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
