      "raw": "<p>This thread is for people who have only one of the Rook City or the Infernal Relics expansion and are looking for someone else who has the other.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Since in the future the Rook City expansion and the Infernal Relics expansion will be published together in a single box, a pair of people who collectively have just one of each could collaborate to get the expansion they need using one of the following methods:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A) Buy and Divide -- The two people buy the combined box and then split the cards. One person or the other keeps the box.</p><p>B) Sell and Buy -- One person sells their existing expansion to the other and then buys the combined box.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Not sure if there&#39;s a need for a place like this, but in case there is, make a post saying what you have and how you&#39;d like to collaborate (Buy and Divide or Sell and Buy) and hopefully you&#39;ll find someone willing to work with you.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
