      "created_at": "2014-01-13T20:42:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I bought the IR/RC combined expansion, despite already owning both of them, so I actually have an extra Rook City and Infernal Relics sitting around.</p><p>My friend recently&nbsp;picked up&nbsp;the Enhanced Edition and I told him I would donate these expansions to him if he wanted them.&nbsp; I haven't heard from him (he's out of the country for a while) and probably won't hear from him until February once he's back, but if by chance he doesn't want them or already purchased the combined expansion, I'd be willing to help someone out if they were looking for either.</p>",
